      "message": "on second thought - i think it will only explore one path as key handler will never be authenticated - it does real HMAC computation and check. So, technically it is better to store some number of key handles returned by u2f_generate() and use it for u2f_sign() rather than filling it with random values. Same applies to u2f_attest().",
